  "prefLabel": "Fis 2101.02 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 2101.02 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Department” means the New Hampshire fish and game department.\n\n(b) “Unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV)” means “unmanned aerial vehicle” or “UAV” as defined in RSA 207:57, I-a. The term shall include drones.\n\nSource. #13752, eff 9-25-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis2100.html"
}
